# for This test , need to:
# - Prepare the TL  (modify / adapt UE capa to support 4 Layers)
# - Ciphering and integrity protection at PDCP : zuc and snow3G shall not be used for TPut higher than 25Mbps
# as they computationally intensive algorithms and are supported by Airphone only for functional tests.
# AES should be the preferred algorithm. The ciphering algorithm preference shall be updated on the gNB side using the parameter "cipherPrefL"
# With AES ciphering algorithm, downlink throughput shall be restricted to 1.2Gbps in SA and 1Gbps in NSA in default UTE cloud VM used for WTS.
# Once the ciphering offload is enabled by default from QT, the limitation for SA shall be removed.
# Ciphering offload will be enabled once the work item planned in FPB-743673.
# For NSA the limitation at 1Gbps will remain as is as there are no plans to increase the EPCSIM TPut with default UTE cloud VM used for WTS.
# - set w_UE_CSI_TM_for_4_4_DL_MIMO=True to Activate ue csi TM with cqi reported = 15 and RI reported = 3

PRV_CB007487_UE_Traffic_Throughput_NSA_Cell1_maxTput_4_4_DL_Mimo
